%% UC-30 — Query / ingest knowledge base via MCP
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AG as AI Agent (Claude / MCP client)
    participant MCP as knowledge-mcp (FastMCP, SSE :8002)
    participant LR as LightRAG

    AG->>MCP: Connect via SSE, list tools
    MCP-->>AG: search_knowledge, ingest_document
    alt search
        AG->>MCP: call search_knowledge {query}
        MCP->>LR: POST /query {query, mode: "hybrid"}
        LR-->>MCP: synthesized answer + context
        MCP-->>AG: tool result
    else ingest
        AG->>MCP: call ingest_document {text}
        MCP->>LR: POST /documents/text
        LR-->>MCP: accepted (background indexing)
        MCP-->>AG: status
    end
    Note over MCP: Every tool call logged to stdout
